      "definition": "Hit the time limit while at least 50% of its last 8 actions repeated earlier actions of the same trial."
    },
    {
      "category": "finished wrong",
      "definition": "The agent stopped on its own and the task's tests (or GAIA's exact-match check) failed."
    },
    {
      "category": "never started",
      "definition": "The harness never ran (e.g. its in-sandbox install failed); counted unsolved."
    },
    {
      "category": "looked up answer",
      "definition": "A tool call referenced the benchmark itself (its repo or site), e.g. to copy an expected answer; never counted solved even if the verifier passed."
